26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PassWithoutTrace_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PassWithoutTrace_Ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PassWithoutTrace_Ring\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c0bce741-9829-49c5-9778-426f2b00a642</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c0bce741-9829-49c5-9778-426f2b00a642\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c0bce741-9829-49c5-9778-426f2b00a642\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PassWithoutTrace_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PassWithoutTrace_Ring+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PassWithoutTrace_Ring+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pass_Without_Trace\" title=\"Pass Without Trace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp/40px-Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp/60px-Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp/80px-Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pass Without Trace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp/40px-Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Pass_Without_Trace_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pass_Without_Trace\" title=\"Pass Without Trace\">Pass Without Trace</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Call forth a veil of shadow and silence that gives you and nearby allies a +10 bonus to <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/34px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/45px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span>  <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">checks</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/House_in_Deep_Shadows\" title=\"House in Deep Shadows\">House in Deep Shadows</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;76&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;37</span>: Rewarded by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/38px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/50px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oliver\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Oliver.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\">Oliver</a>, for playing both rounds of hide and seek with him (regardless of winning or losing)</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This ring can also be obtained by <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">knocking out</a> Oliver out or through <a href=\"/wiki/Stealing\" title=\"Stealing\">pick-pocketing</a> him at the exact moment the encounter becomes a tactical turn based encounter and before he vanishes, or if invisible creatures such as he can be seen. Pick-pocketing Oliver does not change how he interacts with the party.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item can be unequipped after casting Pass Without Trace from it; the caster will still receive the use of Pass Without Trace until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\